<p>TOTAL September 1996 to February 1997 - 471,612 tonnes</p>
<p>TOTAL September 1995 to February 1996 - 676,775 tonnes</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
